  <name>Murkmask</name>
  <summary>A Survival Horror Game set in a Fictional Universe Starring the McGuire family</summary>

  <description>
    <p>
      Murkmask is a survival horror game set in a fictional universe starring the McGuire family, where a dangerous contamination has spread across the Block.
    </p>
    <p>
      Explore contaminated environments, uncover the mystery behind the outbreak, and survive the horrors in the very house you live in.
    </p>
  </description>

